1
00:00:09,240 --> 00:00:12,530
♪Mighty winds carry me to the heavens♪

2
00:00:12,760 --> 00:00:15,700
♪On a wild steed,
I sing, smiling at the mortal world♪

3
00:00:16,130 --> 00:00:18,530
♪Then the cold night veils the stars♪

4
00:00:18,750 --> 00:00:21,710
♪I fall to the depths, yet walk alone♪

5
00:00:22,980 --> 00:00:26,050
♪I brave countless snowy peaks♪

6
00:00:26,320 --> 00:00:29,270
♪Your lingering warmth still fills
my palm♪

7
00:00:29,640 --> 00:00:32,070
♪Though frost and snow may bar my way♪

8
00:00:32,310 --> 00:00:35,940
♪The light in my eyes will never fade♪

9
00:00:36,290 --> 00:00:39,410
♪With a sword that cleaves the clouds♪

10
00:00:39,840 --> 00:00:42,760
♪With a heart as firm as stone♪

11
00:00:43,240 --> 00:00:45,680
♪Through all I've endured,
I have no regrets♪

12
00:00:45,960 --> 00:00:49,010
♪I'm still the boy I once was♪

13
00:00:56,940 --> 00:00:58,860
=Sword God=

14
00:00:59,140 --> 00:01:00,380
=Episode 2=

15
00:01:00,960 --> 00:01:01,520
Holy Maiden.

16
00:01:01,880 --> 00:01:03,880
Why are you still after Zhao Feiyang?

17
00:01:04,359 --> 00:01:06,719
He's of no use to us now.

18
00:01:06,959 --> 00:01:09,200
Do you know of the Nine Heavens Codex?

19
00:01:09,480 --> 00:01:10,200
Of course.

20
00:01:10,640 --> 00:01:11,799
You mean...

21
00:01:12,400 --> 00:01:13,560
The Nine Heavens Codex

22
00:01:14,079 --> 00:01:15,000
is tied to the Zhao family?

23
00:01:15,239 --> 00:01:16,120
Most likely.

24
00:01:16,439 --> 00:01:18,280
Otherwise, Nether Hall

25
00:01:18,519 --> 00:01:20,319
would never have gone to such
lengths to attack

26
00:01:20,480 --> 00:01:21,920
a minor family.

27
00:01:22,120 --> 00:01:23,599
What exactly does

28
00:01:24,200 --> 00:01:25,439
the Nine Heavens Codex do?

29
00:01:25,560 --> 00:01:26,599
The Nine Heavens Codex

30
00:01:27,239 --> 00:01:28,239
is the source of all

31
00:01:28,239 --> 00:01:30,280
cultivation arts and martial techniques
on the Shenwu Continent.

32
00:01:31,280 --> 00:01:32,400
With it,

33
00:01:33,120 --> 00:01:35,400
even the most difficult ones

34
00:01:36,079 --> 00:01:37,599
can be comprehended in an instant.

35
00:01:38,040 --> 00:01:39,079
I see.

36
00:01:41,680 --> 00:01:45,079
If the Zhao family
really had a lead on the Codex,

37
00:01:45,640 --> 00:01:47,840
Zhao Feiyang would be the only one
who knows about it.

38
00:01:48,319 --> 00:01:50,120
Should we seize him and make him talk?

39
00:01:50,599 --> 00:01:52,040
Zhao Feiyang has an iron will.

40
00:01:52,560 --> 00:01:54,200
Forcing him to talk won't work.

41
00:01:54,799 --> 00:01:56,599
He is stubborn to the core.

42
00:01:58,040 --> 00:01:59,719
But he already has...

43
00:01:59,879 --> 00:02:01,560
She's nothing but some village woman.

44
00:02:02,200 --> 00:02:04,959
Find a chance to kill her quietly.

45
00:02:05,359 --> 00:02:05,959
Yes.

46
00:02:07,680 --> 00:02:08,199
Dear.

47
00:02:08,400 --> 00:02:10,240
Guess what I made for you.

48
00:02:11,870 --> 00:02:13,150
(Bai Xi, Bai Xi.)

49
00:02:14,030 --> 00:02:15,360
(My meridians are ruined,)

50
00:02:15,710 --> 00:02:16,910
(and my Dao Bone was ripped out.)

51
00:02:17,470 --> 00:02:19,360
(Why would you stay
with someone as useless as me?)

52
00:02:19,960 --> 00:02:22,030
(What are you really after?)

53
00:02:23,319 --> 00:02:24,039
I have no idea.

54
00:02:26,800 --> 00:02:27,719
Braised fish.

55
00:02:28,240 --> 00:02:30,120
I went to a lot of trouble to find it.

56
00:02:30,319 --> 00:02:32,360
I made it especially
to help you regain your strength.

57
00:02:33,599 --> 00:02:34,319
What's this?

58
00:02:36,599 --> 00:02:37,479
A scale.

59
00:02:38,000 --> 00:02:38,520
A fish scale?

60
00:02:41,319 --> 00:02:42,080
Dear,

61
00:02:42,400 --> 00:02:43,280
what's wrong?

62
00:02:44,039 --> 00:02:45,639
Why are you so startled?

63
00:02:46,150 --> 00:02:47,520
(So it was just a fish scale.)

64
00:02:48,710 --> 00:02:50,150
(I misjudged her.)

65
00:02:54,960 --> 00:02:55,520
Bai.

66
00:02:56,639 --> 00:02:57,159
I'm sorry.

67
00:02:57,560 --> 00:02:58,319
Dear,

68
00:02:59,560 --> 00:03:01,680
what's gotten into you today?

69
00:03:02,280 --> 00:03:04,400
You keep saying strange things.

70
00:03:07,080 --> 00:03:07,520
It's nothing.

71
00:03:08,520 --> 00:03:09,840
Come on, let's have some fish.

72
00:03:10,439 --> 00:03:11,360
You worked hard today.

73
00:03:13,120 --> 00:03:13,879
Not at all.

74
00:03:19,319 --> 00:03:20,159
You eat first, dear.

75
00:03:25,599 --> 00:03:26,240
Is it good?

76
00:03:31,520 --> 00:03:32,120
Have some more.

77
00:03:39,039 --> 00:03:39,639
Let's eat.

78
00:03:52,360 --> 00:03:53,199
Darn.

79
00:03:54,000 --> 00:03:55,280
So without a Dao Bone,

80
00:03:57,599 --> 00:04:00,000
I can't even absorb
spiritual energy anymore?

81
00:04:02,560 --> 00:04:04,319
I still haven't avenged my family.

82
00:04:06,680 --> 00:04:08,639
Am I doomed to spend
the rest of my life barely surviving?

83
00:04:13,840 --> 00:04:14,439
Dear,

84
00:04:14,879 --> 00:04:15,639
what's wrong?

85
00:04:16,480 --> 00:04:17,240
Are you all right?

86
00:04:23,199 --> 00:04:23,720
I'm fine.

87
00:04:25,199 --> 00:04:26,519
My old wounds are acting up.

88
00:04:26,920 --> 00:04:28,040
You look awful.

89
00:04:29,720 --> 00:04:31,120
Soak your feet and get some rest.

90
00:04:31,319 --> 00:04:33,639
I'll chop wood tomorrow
and sell it for silver.

91
00:04:33,959 --> 00:04:35,000
Then I'll buy medicine.

92
00:04:37,040 --> 00:04:37,480
No.

93
00:04:38,439 --> 00:04:39,519
I'll collect my stipend tomorrow.

94
00:04:39,720 --> 00:04:40,759
I can sell it to buy medicine.

95
00:04:41,519 --> 00:04:42,519
The mountains are full of wild beasts.

96
00:04:43,360 --> 00:04:44,360
It isn't safe to go alone.

97
00:04:46,160 --> 00:04:47,160
No,

98
00:04:47,399 --> 00:04:47,959
dear.

99
00:04:48,480 --> 00:04:49,480
Earning your monthly stipend

100
00:04:49,600 --> 00:04:50,639
is hard enough already.

101
00:04:51,360 --> 00:04:52,519
I have nothing else to do.

102
00:04:52,920 --> 00:04:54,480
Every bit I save helps.

103
00:05:20,800 --> 00:05:21,519
Here, dear.

104
00:05:22,759 --> 00:05:23,920
Why are you so good to me?

105
00:05:24,759 --> 00:05:26,199
I'm useless now.

106
00:05:27,079 --> 00:05:27,519
I...

107
00:05:28,560 --> 00:05:29,680
I can't give you a future.

108
00:05:30,360 --> 00:05:32,759
Are you sick of me?

109
00:05:33,680 --> 00:05:34,360
Of course not.

110
00:05:34,920 --> 00:05:35,720
I just feel

111
00:05:36,000 --> 00:05:37,319
I don't deserve your kindness.

112
00:05:39,319 --> 00:05:40,000
You do.

113
00:05:40,800 --> 00:05:42,120
When I was gravely wounded,

114
00:05:42,519 --> 00:05:43,680
you cared for me for months.

115
00:05:45,639 --> 00:05:46,720
To heal me,

116
00:05:47,319 --> 00:05:48,519
you even stole

117
00:05:48,720 --> 00:05:50,120
the sect's finest herbs.

118
00:05:51,079 --> 00:05:51,839
For that,

119
00:05:52,160 --> 00:05:53,160
you were punished

120
00:05:53,560 --> 00:05:55,560
with 49 lashes in public.

121
00:05:56,199 --> 00:05:56,879
So tell me.

122
00:05:57,120 --> 00:05:58,399
If I don't care for you now,

123
00:05:59,800 --> 00:06:00,680
who else would I care for?

124
00:06:02,439 --> 00:06:04,000
I was only trying to save a life.

125
00:06:06,720 --> 00:06:08,000
Enough. Let's not dwell on it.

126
00:06:08,560 --> 00:06:09,360
Soak your feet.

127
00:06:28,199 --> 00:06:28,759
Dear,

128
00:06:29,240 --> 00:06:30,120
get some sleep.

129
00:06:30,639 --> 00:06:31,560
Don't overthink it.

130
00:06:48,560 --> 00:06:49,120
(Miss.)

131
00:06:49,279 --> 00:06:49,839
(Stay with me.)

132
00:06:50,160 --> 00:06:50,959
(Don't fall asleep.)

133
00:06:51,560 --> 00:06:52,279
(We're almost there.)

134
00:06:53,639 --> 00:06:54,600
(You have to hold on.)

135
00:07:00,800 --> 00:07:01,480
Thank you, Elder Wang.

136
00:07:01,480 --> 00:07:05,520
(Monthly Stipend Day)

137
00:07:05,560 --> 00:07:06,160
Next.

138
00:07:09,879 --> 00:07:10,560
Thank you, Elder.

139
00:07:11,639 --> 00:07:12,199
Next.

140
00:07:13,160 --> 00:07:15,160
I'm Zhao Feiyang.
I'm here to collect my stipend.

141
00:07:15,439 --> 00:07:17,360
(Zhao Feiyang, Outer Sect Servant)
Zhao Feiyang? Your rank?

142
00:07:18,000 --> 00:07:18,439
Elder Wang.

143
00:07:18,920 --> 00:07:19,439
You know...

144
00:07:19,439 --> 00:07:21,420
(Elder Wang, Heavenly Sword Sect)

145
00:07:27,399 --> 00:07:29,040
A... a servant disciple.

146
00:07:35,439 --> 00:07:36,120
That's more like it.

147
00:07:36,480 --> 00:07:36,920
Here.

148
00:07:37,199 --> 00:07:38,600
Servant disciple Zhao Feiyang.

149
00:07:38,959 --> 00:07:39,959
Low-grade spirit crystals.

150
00:07:40,480 --> 00:07:41,199
Two.

151
00:07:46,580 --> 00:07:47,620
(Zhao Feiyang)

152
00:07:48,720 --> 00:07:49,240
Elder.

153
00:07:49,959 --> 00:07:51,560
Servant disciples get
three spirit crystals a month.

154
00:07:51,959 --> 00:07:52,839
Why did I only get two?

155
00:07:52,959 --> 00:07:54,439
Without the Sect Master's kindness,

156
00:07:54,800 --> 00:07:56,519
someone like you, with no Dao Bone

157
00:07:56,639 --> 00:07:58,040
and ruined meridians,

158
00:07:58,319 --> 00:08:00,199
wouldn't even qualify
as a servant disciple.

159
00:08:00,560 --> 00:08:02,360
You're a waste of resources,

160
00:08:02,879 --> 00:08:03,879
yet you still complain?

161
00:08:04,079 --> 00:08:05,519
Take it or get out.

162
00:08:05,959 --> 00:08:07,000
No sect on the Shenwu Continent

163
00:08:07,319 --> 00:08:08,480
would ever take you.

164
00:08:09,040 --> 00:08:09,639
Exactly.

165
00:08:09,639 --> 00:08:10,800
You got yours. Now leave.

166
00:08:10,879 --> 00:08:11,920
You're wasting our time.

167
00:08:11,959 --> 00:08:12,720
Hurry up.

168
00:08:12,759 --> 00:08:13,639
We're all waiting.

169
00:08:13,680 --> 00:08:14,920
We've been waiting here.

170
00:08:16,000 --> 00:08:16,639
Move it.

171
00:08:16,720 --> 00:08:17,879
Get out.

172
00:08:17,959 --> 00:08:18,639
A servant disciple.

173
00:08:18,680 --> 00:08:19,560
What a joke.

174
00:08:19,759 --> 00:08:20,240
Exactly.

175
00:08:20,360 --> 00:08:21,480
He should know his place.

176
00:08:21,600 --> 00:08:22,600
What else does he want?

177
00:08:22,720 --> 00:08:23,439
As if he's worthy.

178
00:08:23,480 --> 00:08:24,160
Get lost.

179
00:08:27,600 --> 00:08:28,519
Thank you, Elder.

180
00:08:38,440 --> 00:08:39,360
Get going.

181
00:08:39,799 --> 00:08:40,799
Yeah, get out of here.

182
00:08:41,200 --> 00:08:41,799
Go.

183
00:08:43,340 --> 00:08:44,180
(Stillness Upholds the Sect)

184
00:08:45,919 --> 00:08:47,519
Got your stipend, Zhao Feiyang?

185
00:08:48,559 --> 00:08:50,039
They actually gave you
two spirit crystals.

186
00:08:50,720 --> 00:08:51,840
We formal disciples

187
00:08:52,159 --> 00:08:53,440
only get 15.

188
00:08:53,759 --> 00:08:54,799
All you do is train as usual

189
00:08:54,919 --> 00:08:55,960
and you get 15 crystals.

190
00:08:56,320 --> 00:08:56,759
I work daily,

191
00:08:56,759 --> 00:08:58,399
doing 12 hours of filthy,
backbreaking work.

192
00:08:58,720 --> 00:08:59,720
You think two is a lot?

193
00:09:01,960 --> 00:09:03,039
If that's all, I'll be going.

194
00:09:05,159 --> 00:09:06,000
You can go.

195
00:09:07,000 --> 00:09:07,799
Leave the spirit crystals.

196
00:09:08,519 --> 00:09:09,480
You're robbing me outright.

197
00:09:10,240 --> 00:09:11,639
Don't make it sound so ugly.

198
00:09:12,159 --> 00:09:13,240
We're keeping them safe for you.

199
00:09:13,440 --> 00:09:13,919
Understand?

200
00:09:14,240 --> 00:09:14,720
Get him.

201
00:09:25,399 --> 00:09:25,879
Trash.

202
00:09:26,440 --> 00:09:27,039
Stop.

203
00:09:34,399 --> 00:09:35,919
Greetings, Holy Maiden.

204
00:09:36,320 --> 00:09:37,639
Are all Heavenly Sword Sect disciples

205
00:09:37,840 --> 00:09:39,120
this lawless?

206
00:09:40,240 --> 00:09:41,919
You dare rob a fellow disciple.

207
00:09:42,360 --> 00:09:43,480
Perhaps I should

208
00:09:43,639 --> 00:09:45,440
report this to the sect elders.

209
00:09:45,519 --> 00:09:46,240
You misunderstand, Holy Maiden.

210
00:09:46,399 --> 00:09:48,279
We were only sparring with Zhao Feiyang.

211
00:09:48,399 --> 00:09:49,720
Let me make this clear.

212
00:09:50,159 --> 00:09:52,440
Zhao Feiyang is my fiancé.

213
00:09:53,440 --> 00:09:55,000
Before you lay a hand on him,

214
00:09:55,440 --> 00:09:56,759
remember who you're dealing with.

215
00:09:57,240 --> 00:09:57,840
Yes, yes.

216
00:10:01,480 --> 00:10:01,879
Let's go.

217
00:10:20,279 --> 00:10:20,919
Zhao Feiyang.

218
00:10:21,600 --> 00:10:22,879
Get this straight.

219
00:10:23,480 --> 00:10:24,759
I was helping you.

220
00:10:25,399 --> 00:10:26,480
Thank you, Holy Maiden.

221
00:10:27,080 --> 00:10:28,240
But please stop telling people

222
00:10:28,240 --> 00:10:29,159
that I'm your fiancé.

223
00:10:29,759 --> 00:10:31,080
I'm not worthy of that title.

224
00:10:31,960 --> 00:10:33,320
Besides, I already have a wife.

225
00:10:39,799 --> 00:10:40,759
You mean that woman?

226
00:10:40,919 --> 00:10:42,120
(Stillness Upholds the Sect)
Think I'm a fool?

227
00:10:42,240 --> 00:10:43,480
You think I can't tell
you're putting on an act?

228
00:10:43,919 --> 00:10:45,080
I don't know what you mean.

229
00:10:45,799 --> 00:10:47,039
My wife is waiting at home.

230
00:10:50,270 --> 00:10:51,840
(Zhao Feiyang.)

231
00:10:52,270 --> 00:10:53,840
(You would rather break than bend.)

232
00:10:54,360 --> 00:10:55,840
(You won't be seeing)

233
00:10:56,150 --> 00:10:57,630
(that so-called wife of yours again.)

234
00:10:58,200 --> 00:11:00,910
(Once you have nothing
and no one left,)

235
00:11:01,030 --> 00:11:02,790
(we'll see how long
you can keep acting tough.)

236
00:11:16,799 --> 00:11:17,519
I'm home.

237
00:11:45,879 --> 00:11:46,919
What are you...

238
00:11:47,879 --> 00:11:48,559
Kill her.

239
00:11:49,120 --> 00:11:50,879
Dump her deep in the mountains.

240
00:11:54,559 --> 00:11:55,039
Stop.

241
00:12:00,159 --> 00:12:00,639
Bai.

242
00:12:00,960 --> 00:12:01,559
Dear.

243
00:12:03,559 --> 00:12:04,039
You're safe.

244
00:12:04,600 --> 00:12:05,120
I'm here.

245
00:12:10,320 --> 00:12:11,080
Who are you?

246
00:12:13,000 --> 00:12:13,960
You're cultivators.

247
00:12:14,559 --> 00:12:15,960
Why attack an ordinary woman?

248
00:12:16,279 --> 00:12:16,919
Get lost.

249
00:12:17,759 --> 00:12:19,320
Or we'll kill you too.

250
00:12:39,519 --> 00:12:40,039
Everyone,

251
00:12:40,399 --> 00:12:41,559
we're just common folk.

252
00:12:41,879 --> 00:12:43,039
I'm a disciple
of the Heavenly Sword Sect.

253
00:12:45,080 --> 00:12:46,200
I have two spirit crystals.

254
00:12:46,799 --> 00:12:47,600
You can have them both.

255
00:12:47,919 --> 00:12:48,600
I only ask

256
00:12:49,320 --> 00:12:50,399
that you spare our lives.

257
00:13:02,519 --> 00:13:03,799
What an annoying weakling.

258
00:13:04,759 --> 00:13:05,320
Dear.

259
00:13:05,919 --> 00:13:06,399
Dear.

260
00:13:07,519 --> 00:13:08,000
Dear.

261
00:13:14,000 --> 00:13:14,559
Do it.

262
00:13:24,759 --> 00:13:26,399
She's just a mortal.

263
00:13:26,960 --> 00:13:27,919
What's taking so long?

264
00:13:58,840 --> 00:14:00,440
Who in the world are you?

265
00:14:01,279 --> 00:14:02,080
Want to know?

266
00:14:02,720 --> 00:14:04,080
Then I'll show you.

267
00:14:16,480 --> 00:14:20,270
♪I once stood on high,
drawing spiritual energy into my blade♪

268
00:14:20,520 --> 00:14:22,670
♪I laughed, pointing at the stars,
young and fearless♪

269
00:14:23,240 --> 00:14:26,790
♪Then came my fall,
with frost and snow on my shoulders♪

270
00:14:26,920 --> 00:14:31,350
♪My Dao foundation was damaged,
yet my Dao heart never wavered♪

271
00:14:31,520 --> 00:14:34,670
♪I crossed countless peaks
to find my answer again♪

272
00:14:35,510 --> 00:14:38,180
♪Through endless trials,
my Nascent Soul came♪

273
00:14:38,400 --> 00:14:41,800
♪Heaven and earth my furnace,
I rose from the flame♪

274
00:14:41,880 --> 00:14:45,610
♪No sword in hand,
yet numberless blades obey♪

275
00:14:46,480 --> 00:14:49,650
♪I seek the Dao beyond the clouds♪

276
00:14:49,920 --> 00:14:53,040
♪Unafraid of countless trials♪

277
00:14:53,840 --> 00:14:56,360
♪With this flesh and soul♪

278
00:14:56,680 --> 00:14:59,910
♪I shall forge a new age♪

279
00:15:00,120 --> 00:15:02,990
♪Let thunder and fire crown me♪

280
00:15:03,360 --> 00:15:06,450
♪Let wind and clouds heed me♪

281
00:15:06,670 --> 00:15:09,310
♪At cultivation's peak♪

282
00:15:09,320 --> 00:15:12,670
♪My first resolve remains unchanged♪

283
00:15:13,440 --> 00:15:16,150
♪The sun and moon turn♪

284
